# Miquel point of a complete quadrilateral — the circumcircles of the four triangles of a complete quadrilateral share a point (source: Steiner/Miquel; Johnson)
A B C = triangle
D = free
E = meet(line(A, B), line(C, D))
F = meet(line(A, D), line(B, C))
M = meet(circumcircle(E, A, D), circumcircle(E, B, C))
prove cyclic(A, B, F, M)
